# Changelog - GUTS & GUYS Apparel Website

All notable developments and commit updates for this project are recorded below:

## [1.2.0] - 2026-08-14
### Added
- Linked high-resolution men's fashion and suit imagery from Unsplash across all pages.
- Embedded store map frame pointing to Polokwane boutique region on `pages/contact.html`.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-11
### Added
- Configured structured fitting request form inputs on `pages/enquiry.html`.
- Implemented company history, master tailor qualifications, and sustainable textile details on `pages/aboutus.html`.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-05
### Added
- Initialized Git repository structure.
- Developed multi-page HTML semantic layout and global menu header navigation.
